meta {
  name: Get Finance Insights (College Admin)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/college-admin/payments/finance/insights
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{staffAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Collections health, pipeline, outflows, and per-course revenue for this
  college. Requires staff_member auth + finance.view. All-time, no filters —
  same "Overall Performance" scope as /finance/overview.

  Response:
  {
    receivables: {
      totalOutstanding: number,     // SUM(balance_amount), unpaid BILLED course fees
                                    // (fee_structure_id set) with balance > 0
      aging: [                      // exhaustive + disjoint; sums to totalOutstanding
        { key, label, amount, count }
      ]                             // keys: not_yet_due, overdue_1_30, overdue_31_60,
                                    //       overdue_61_90, overdue_90_plus, no_due_date
    },
    awaitingVerification: { amount, count },  // verification_status = pending_verification
    failedPayments:        { amount, count },  // per FEE, not per attempt: unpaid pay-to-proceed
                                               // fees with a failed/rejected attempt and no
                                               // resubmission awaiting verification. amount = balance
    abandonedPayments:     { amount, count },  // per fee: unpaid pay-to-proceed fees whose online
                                               // checkout sat pending over 24h, with no failure,
                                               // no fresh attempt, and no pending verification
    missingReceipts:       { amount, count },  // completed, no payment_receipts row, older than 1h
    refunds: {
      refundedAmount, refundedCount,           // seat_cancellations.refund_status = processed
      pendingRefundAmount, pendingRefundCount, // refund_amount > 0, not processed, not rejected
      penaltiesCollected, penaltiesCount       // penalty_paid_at set
    },
    tokenPipeline: {
      expectedAmount, expectedCount,           // issued offers, token pending, valid_until >= today
      lapsedAmount, lapsedCount                // same but past valid_until
    },
    scholarships: {
      approvedDiscountAmount, approvedCount,   // scholarship_applications approved
      pendingCount
    },
    revenueByCourse: [
      { courseId: string | null, courseName, amount, count }
    ]                                          // completed revenue, desc; sums to totalRevenue
  }

  Caveats:
  - Unpaid ledger rows are partitioned with no overlap: billed course fees are
    receivables; unfinished pay-to-proceed attempts are failed or abandoned
    (failed wins). Every pay-to-proceed flow creates its ledger row when
    checkout starts, so those rows are not money anyone owes.
  - The overdue aging buckets use the same predicate as /overview's
    overdueBalance (due_date before today in IST), so they sum to that card.
    A fee is not overdue on its own due date.
  - tokenPipeline is split on valid_until because there is no offer-expiry
    job: lapsed offers stay "issued" with a pending token indefinitely.
  - Penalties are recorded without creating a Transaction, so they are NOT
    part of totalRevenue — they are additional money collected.
  - revenueByCourse links a payment to its course via the ledger's application
    course, enrollment, or fee structure (course fees link only through the
    fee structure). The one courseId-null row is hostel booking and commute.
  - scholarships.approvedDiscountAmount is the value approved. It is not yet
    deducted from student_fee_ledger.scholarship_discount, which nothing
    writes today.
}
